00:50:07.000 --> 00:50:13.000
and that we didn't give it to him, that, you know, he gets it from somebody else,

00:50:13.000 --> 00:50:20.000
A man: there's still our duty to go again, or to (unintelligible)?

00:50:20.000 --> 00:50:22.000
Dr. Khalifa: Did he get the message from another source?

00:50:23.000 --> 00:50:27.000
A man: Yes, from another believer, but they, they refused.

00:50:27.000 --> 00:50:28.000
Dr. Khalifa: Oh, I see.

00:50:28.000 --> 00:50:35.000
Well, if the circumstances come up, we're supposed to give the message anyway. When the circumstances come up.

00:50:37.000 --> 00:50:40.000
God will create the circumstances for us to deliver the message.

00:50:41.000 --> 00:50:44.000
But we must strive, we need to strive.

00:50:45.000 --> 00:50:46.000
We need to do something.

00:50:50.000 --> 00:50:58.000
You know, as it is, the majority of people believe in God alone, worship the Quran alone, worship God alone, and that's it.

00:50:58.000 --> 00:51:00.000
They're believers, and they're good.

00:51:01.000 --> 00:51:02.000
They're going to Heaven.

00:51:03.000 --> 00:51:08.000
But they are not the same as people who strive for just (unintelligible).

00:51:09.000 --> 00:51:10.000
Hey, look who's here.

00:51:11.000 --> 00:51:12.000
The Turners are here.

00:51:14.000 --> 00:51:15.000
Come on in, come on in.

00:51:17.000 --> 00:51:18.000
Dr. Khalifa: Mã Shã Allãh

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:31.000
A woman: Mã Shã Allãh

00:51:31.000 --> 00:51:33.000
Dr. Khalifa: You left Omnia home.

00:51:37.000 --> 00:51:38.000
‘Alaykum Al-Salãm

00:51:40.000 --> 00:51:41.000
Dr. Khalifa: She's asleep here in Tucson? A woman: Yes.

00:51:41.000 --> 00:51:43.000
Dr. Khalifa: Oh, OK. I know how it is.

00:51:47.000 --> 00:51:48.000
Dr. Khalifa: Mã Shã Allãh

00:51:49.000 --> 00:51:57.000
Parivash: Rashad, I have a question. If, for example, my sister asked me to give her a...

00:51:57.000 --> 00:51:58.000
Dr. Khalifa: Loan.

00:51:58.000 --> 00:52:01.000
Parivash: OK, and she's very believer, and I trust her.

00:52:01.000 --> 00:52:05.000
Parivash: (unintelligible) I commit sin if I don't have it...

00:52:05.000 --> 00:52:06.000
Behrouz: written down.

00:52:06.000 --> 00:52:07.000
Parivash: Yes. But God says Dr. Khalifa: written down?

00:52:07.000 --> 00:52:09.000
Parivash: (unintelligible)

00:52:09.000 --> 00:52:16.000
Dr. Khalifa: If, if, if in your mind you don't, you don't care if she keeps the money, and you never get it back, then it's OK.

00:52:16.000 --> 00:52:17.000
Parivash: Ok.

00:52:17.000 --> 00:52:25.000
Dr. Khalifa: But if you want it to, to be repaid, God tells us to write it down, so you don't forget how much you gave her, and she doesn't forget how much she borrowed.

00:52:25.000 --> 00:52:26.000
A woman: But if she doesn't care?

00:52:26.000 --> 00:52:30.000
Dr. Khalifa: But if you don't care, if she ever pays it, then it's OK.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:32.000
A woman: I understand. Ok.

00:52:33.000 --> 00:52:37.000
Dr. Khalifa: This, this you write it down if you expect it to be paid back.

00:52:37.000 --> 00:52:39.000
Because I'm telling you, you'll forget.

00:52:40.000 --> 00:52:46.000
Dr. Khalifa: You may give her $500, and then after a month, you'll be absolutely positive that you gave her $1,000.

00:52:46.000 --> 00:52:47.000
A woman: Right.

00:52:47.000 --> 00:52:49.000
Dr. Khalifa: Sometimes Satan will see to it.

00:52:52.000 --> 00:52:56.000
A woman: And the person who gives the loan (unintelligible)

00:52:57.000 --> 00:53:00.000
Dr. Khalifa: What, the person who's giving the loan is in control.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:02.000
So, it is, the person, right.

00:53:02.000 --> 00:53:11.000
But the person who's taking the loan is the one who dictates the terms, who writes down, writes down the receipt.

00:53:13.000 --> 00:53:24.000
I received $500 from Roxana, and I promise to pay it at $50 a month starting in February, and finish the payment at a certain date.

00:53:24.000 --> 00:53:28.000
So, this is, God gives us the details of what to write.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:32.000
Because it'll be written in the hand of the borrower.

00:53:33.000 --> 00:53:35.000
And then, you have two witnesses.

00:53:36.000 --> 00:53:39.000
This way, there'll be no confusion at all. Subhan Allah.

00:53:39.000 --> 00:53:43.000
Dr. Khalifa: I mean, this was, came down at an age where there were no accountants.

00:53:49.000 --> 00:53:51.000
A man: This 9:58 that

00:53:51.000 --> 00:53:56.000
[9:58] Some of them criticize your distribution of the charities; ...

00:53:56.000 --> 00:53:59.000
But when they receive their share they become satisfied.

00:53:59.000 --> 00:54:04.000
At least, we have seen three different (unintelligible), people who object to the taxes.

00:54:04.000 --> 00:54:12.000
A man: But then, they try to get out as much as possible from the public sector. So, the taxes just go up and up.

00:54:13.000 --> 00:54:17.000
Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, this is true in all countries, it seems, here also.

00:54:17.000 --> 00:54:22.000
No, but this is a specific situation talking about the community of believers.

00:54:23.000 --> 00:54:27.000
And we've seen it also within the community of believers.

00:54:32.000 --> 00:54:34.000
We are living the Quran.

00:54:37.000 --> 00:54:39.000
Dr. Khalifa: So, what was your first question, Naima?

00:54:40.000 --> 00:54:41.000
Naima: (unintelligible)

