00:59:57.000 --> 01:00:00.000
Dr. Khalifa: [39:12] "And I was commanded to be the utmost submitter."

01:00:01.000 --> 01:00:03.000
The utmost submitter never complains.

01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:07.000
That's a sign of submitter or not.

01:00:08.000 --> 01:00:13.000
The utmost submitter is content with whatever God gives us, and understands.

01:00:15.000 --> 01:00:21.000
[39:13] Say, "I fear, if I disobeyed my Lord, the retribution of a great day."

01:00:22.000 --> 01:00:25.000
Submitters also realize that everything has a price.

01:00:28.000 --> 01:00:35.000
And this is now after passing all the tests, and you've passed your final test, you're in good shape,

01:00:35.000 --> 01:00:39.000
then you cannot deviate outside the path that God drew for you.

01:00:40.000 --> 01:00:43.000
Because if you deviate, it's very expensive.

01:00:45.000 --> 01:00:47.000
It seems out of proportion, but really it is not.

01:00:50.000 --> 01:00:55.000
You know, when I, when I got pinched in the past, I'd say "wow, this is too much! I didn't do that bad!"

01:00:55.000 --> 01:01:02.000
And the answer would come back "yes, this is it. You didn't do too bad, but this is the price for it." Yeah.

01:01:03.000 --> 01:01:07.000
The pinch is always way out of proportion, it seems.

01:01:09.000 --> 01:01:17.000
I guess because, you know we, somehow we grew up with the notion that God is forgiving, Merciful, which is true, but we tend to abuse this.

01:01:18.000 --> 01:01:19.000
(unintelligible)

01:01:24.000 --> 01:01:26.000
God wants to make you perfect.

01:01:27.000 --> 01:01:35.000
And the system that I have noticed personally, and maybe you too, is that God will take one of your defects at a time.

01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:41.000
And He will keep after you until you get rid of that defect.

01:01:42.000 --> 01:01:47.000
Then, He will start another one, until you cleanse out of that one.

01:01:48.000 --> 01:01:51.000
The end result is a perfect human being, if there is such a thing.

01:01:52.000 --> 01:01:57.000
You'll be following God's commandments perfectly. And you'll be a perfect human being.

01:02:02.000 --> 01:02:06.000
So, the utmost submitter understands all these things.

01:02:10.000 --> 01:02:14.000
Remember that the utmost submitter has a perfect life.

01:02:15.000 --> 01:02:18.000
The only reason you have a headache is because of something you have done.

01:02:21.000 --> 01:02:24.000
I don't think there are any exceptions to that, there are no exceptions.

01:02:25.000 --> 01:02:33.000
You don't get a scratch or a headache without something you have done. So, it behooves you to find out what it is that you have done.

01:02:34.000 --> 01:02:36.000
Don't defend yourself either.

01:02:38.000 --> 01:02:41.000
I used to laugh when I tell some people "what did you do wrong?"

01:02:41.000 --> 01:02:43.000
They say "I didn't do anything wrong", you know, they become on the defensive.

01:02:44.000 --> 01:02:54.000
I say "hey, wait a minute, you're supposed to join me and, in attacking your "self" and find out what you did wrong. You become very defensive."

01:02:56.000 --> 01:03:00.000
But we're supposed to do this ourselves, we have to find out what did I do wrong.

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:06.000
But if I, if I'm too egotistic to pinpoint what I did wrong, then I just go on,

01:03:06.000 --> 01:03:09.000
because the punishment will continue until you, you know what it is.

01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:13.000
When you know what it is and you repent, it never happens again.

01:03:14.000 --> 01:03:15.000
The problem is solved.

01:03:18.000 --> 01:03:23.000
So, an utmost submitter means no problems of any kind.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:31.000
It's almost unbelievable.

01:03:32.000 --> 01:03:35.000
But you see, God taught us repeatedly.

01:03:35.000 --> 01:03:38.000
God used me as a guinea pig, a happy guinea pig.

01:03:43.000 --> 01:03:48.000
I mean, I put myself, myself in situations where a problem should have, should have happened.

01:03:48.000 --> 01:03:51.000
But it wasn't because of God, so a problem didn't happen.

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:58.000
And the reason I'm saying this is because Ihsan is sitting here, and she expected a big problem.

01:03:58.000 --> 01:03:59.000
Thank you.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:08.000
