01:04:17.000 --> 01:04:19.000
She said "this is it. She's gonna divorce you, you're finished."

01:04:20.000 --> 01:04:22.000
"This is it, a big fight."

01:04:23.000 --> 01:04:27.000
So, as she was approaching this door here to run away,

01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:33.000
she heard us say "I made a batch of Italian cookies, they were so delicious, I'm sorry we finished all of them, so I'm gonna make you another batch."

01:04:36.000 --> 01:04:39.000
She couldn't believe it, until now she can't believe it.

01:04:41.000 --> 01:04:45.000
But this is, God manipulates the minds and the hearts of the people.

